### ==============================================================================
### VOLTFLOW UNIFIED TAXONOMY (VUT) REST CLIENT KOLEKSİYONU (14. HALKA)
### ==============================================================================
### Tüm istekler X-Client-Screen-Id ve X-Client-Action-Id başlıklarıyla izlenir.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5275/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 01: IDENTITY AND AUTH FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name login
# [01.1.01] Kullanıcı Girişi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0110
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-01101

{
  "email": "admin@voltflow.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

# [01.2.01] Master OTP (000000) ile Yeni Kullanıcı Kaydı
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0120
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-01201

{
  "name": "Saha Mühendisi",
  "email": "muhendis.yeni@voltflow.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "otp": "000000"
}

###

# [01.3.01] Oturum İptali (Session Revocation & Logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/session/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0130
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-01301

###

# [01.4.01] Parola Sıfırlama Talebi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/request
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0140
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-01401

{
  "email": "admin@voltflow.com"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 02: QUOTE TO ORDER FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name createCustomer
# [02.1.01] Müşteri Oluşturma (Lead)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0210
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02101

{
  "name": "Bursa Enerji Sistemleri A.Ş.",
  "email": "iletisim@bursaenerji.com",
  "phone": "+90 532 999 88 77"
}

###

# [02.1.01] Müşteri Aktivasyonu (Lead -> Active)
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0210
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02102

###

# @name createQuote
# [02.3.01] Teklif Taslağı Oluşturma
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0230
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02301

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "title": "50kW Güneş Santrali Kurulum Teklifi"
}

###

# [02.4.01] Teklife Kalem Ekleme
@quoteId = {{createQuote.response.body.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0240
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02401

{
  "materialCode": "MAT-PANEL-550W",
  "description": "550W Tier-1 Güneş Paneli",
  "quantity": 100,
  "unitPrice": 4500.00
}

###

# [02.4.01] Teklif Yayınlama ve Kabul (Peşinatlı)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0240
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02402

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0240
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02403

{
  "depositPercentage": 30
}

###

# [02.5.01] Kabul Edilen Teklifi İş Emrine Dönüştürme
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/work-order
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0250
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02501


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 03: WORK ORDER EXECUTION FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [03.1.01] İş Emirlerini Listeleme
GET {{baseUrl}}/work-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0310
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-03101

###

# [03.2.01] İSG Güvenlik Kontrol Listesini Kaydetme
@workOrderId = 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0330
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-03301

{
  "isHighVoltageIsolated": true,
  "isPersonalProtectiveEquipmentVerified": true,
  "isSiteInspected": true
}

###

# [03.3.01] Saha Giriş (Check-In)
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-orders/{{workOrderId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0320
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-03201

{
  "latitude": 40.1885,
  "longitude": 29.0610
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 04: INVENTORY FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [04.1.01] Stok Seviyelerini Görüntüleme
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0410
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-04101

###

# [04.2.01] Malzeme Rezervasyonu
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0420
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-04201

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "materialCode": "MAT-PANEL-550W",
  "quantity": 20
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 05: FINANCE AND LEDGER FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [05.1.01] Müşteri Faturalarını Listeleme
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?customerId={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0510
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-05101

###

# [05.2.01] Tahsilat Girişi (Customer Payment)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0520
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-05201

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "amount": 135000.00,
  "paymentMethod": "BankTransfer",
  "reference": "FT-2026-09-001"
}


###
# [05.3.01] Tahsilatın Faturaya Mahsubu (Allocation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/allocate
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0530
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-05301

{
  "paymentId": "{{paymentId}}",
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "amount": 50000.00
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 07: OPERATIONS AND OUTBOX FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [07.2.01] Dead-Letter Outbox Mesajlarını Sorgulama
GET {{baseUrl}}/operations/outbox/dead-letter
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0720
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-07201

###
# [07.2.03] Outbox Replay Talebi
POST {{baseUrl}}/operations/outbox/replay/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0720
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-07203

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### MODÜL 08: SECURITY AND RESILIENCE FLOWS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [08.1.01] Idempotency Key ile Çifte İstek Güvencesi
POST {{baseUrl}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: IDEMP-TEST-KEY-001
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0230
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-02301

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "title": "Idempotent Test Teklifi"
}

###
# [08.2.01] Dağıtık Hız Sınırlama (Rate Limit Denetimi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0820
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-08201

###
# [08.4.01] RFC 7807 Global Problem Details Doğrulaması
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/problem+json
X-Client-Screen-Id: SCR-0840
X-Client-Action-Id: ACT-08401
